title: "Are World Cup Squads Getting Older?"
#subtitle: "Are World Cup players getting older?"
description: "Is it just a few headliners (i.e., Ronaldo, Messi), or is there a broader trend towards older World Cup players?"
date: 07-01-2026
#categories: [Fun, Sports, Soccer, Age]
citation:
